WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
I didn't hear it just now

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,680
In fact, you don’t need to do this at all.

3
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:03,960
Soldiers at the Huangsha Town Camp

4
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,000
A spit and a nail

5
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,720
Aren't there rumors from the outside that you are all thorns in the side?

6
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:08,640
Just do what you say, otherwise it will be even more embarrassing

7
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,520
The thorn in the side is that we make mistakes and refuse to obey discipline.

8
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,120
It's two different things than how to behave

9
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,560
First impression of Huangsha Town

10
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:15,000
It seems that I need to change it a bit quietly.

11
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,300
The new recruits will be tough on you this time.

12
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:22,160
I'll remember what happened this time

13
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:23,940
Then I will remember you too

14
00:00:25,070 --> 00:00:31,500
what are you doing

15
00:00:31,820 --> 00:00:32,780
Don't think I'm afraid of you

16
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:46,380
I want my reporting information to belong to this brother

17
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:48,940
I wonder if you can take me to the Commander-in-Chief to make a formal report?

18
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:52,230
Just because you're a good boy

19
00:00:52,470 --> 00:00:53,510
Just treat it as a good deed
